\end_inset

 is optimal because 
\begin_inset Formula $E(u_{i}|b_{i}=2)=\frac{1}{2}$
\end_inset

, while 
\begin_inset Formula $E(u_{i}|b_{i}=\mbox{No})=0$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $E(u_{i}|b_{i}=1)=\frac{1}{2}$
\end_inset

, and 
