\end_inset

.
 Therefore, this bidding function is a symmetric BNE since none of the bidders
 have an incentive to deviate.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Proof
\begin_inset space \quad{}
\end_inset

Under this symmetric BNE, the ex ante expected payment of bidder 
\begin_inset Formula $i$
\end_inset

 in the auction is
